        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graviton Flux is a fun action-packed puzzle game. A strange anomaly has developed and it is attracting different types of particles. Rotate the central core to match similarly colored particles with each other. Connecting three or more similarly colored particles will make them explode and disappear. This prevents too many particles from accumulating and reaching the outer ring which will cause a catastrophic explosion and end the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the FREE demo! The demo has a score limit of 220000 points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/696276a5d1b61e13ca6b2e7cb276e0b3.poster.avif?t=1777163183\" width=300 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/696276a5d1b61e13ca6b2e7cb276e0b3.webm?t=1777163183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to last as long as possible. There are an unlimited number of levels, but they get progressively harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The black particles are special. They can only be destroyed by destroying a group of three or more particles of another color, while this group is attached to the black particles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/e53d09868fe4abbe2a4a4dabf6af0642.poster.avif?t=1777163183\" width=300 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/e53d09868fe4abbe2a4a4dabf6af0642.webm?t=1777163183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If things get too hectic, you can use a bomb, if you have one available, to destroy all of the particles at once. You won't get any points, but it can save you from losing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/3be067e06e1d4bef98b96a0579ef2e0c.poster.avif?t=1777163183\" width=300 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/3be067e06e1d4bef98b96a0579ef2e0c.webm?t=1777163183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also slow down time by using a time warp, if you have one available. This is useful for tricky or important maneuvers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you rarely mismatch the colors of the particles, a bonus mode will be triggered. White particles will begin to appear and these can destroy any particles they touch. White particles give bonus points when destroying other particles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/d3b0f8cc2d345cab95cccc904333ca9c.poster.avif?t=1777163183\" width=300 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/d3b0f8cc2d345cab95cccc904333ca9c.webm?t=1777163183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are six ranks: Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum, Master and Grandmaster. Try to make it Grandmaster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/4d1cbf719d6dcf4d25031690baf38667.avif?t=1777163183\" width=1489 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the FREE demo! The demo has a score limit of 220000 points.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graviton Flux is a fun action-packed puzzle game. A strange anomaly has developed and it is attracting different types of particles. Rotate the central core to match similarly colored particles with each other. Connecting three or more similarly colored particles will make them explode and disappear. This prevents too many particles from accumulating and reaching the outer ring which will cause a catastrophic explosion and end the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the FREE demo! The demo has a score limit of 220000 points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/696276a5d1b61e13ca6b2e7cb276e0b3.poster.avif?t=1777163183\" width=300 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/696276a5d1b61e13ca6b2e7cb276e0b3.webm?t=1777163183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to last as long as possible. There are an unlimited number of levels, but they get progressively harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The black particles are special. They can only be destroyed by destroying a group of three or more particles of another color, while this group is attached to the black particles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/e53d09868fe4abbe2a4a4dabf6af0642.poster.avif?t=1777163183\" width=300 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/e53d09868fe4abbe2a4a4dabf6af0642.webm?t=1777163183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If things get too hectic, you can use a bomb, if you have one available, to destroy all of the particles at once. You won't get any points, but it can save you from losing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/3be067e06e1d4bef98b96a0579ef2e0c.poster.avif?t=1777163183\" width=300 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/3be067e06e1d4bef98b96a0579ef2e0c.webm?t=1777163183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also slow down time by using a time warp, if you have one available. This is useful for tricky or important maneuvers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you rarely mismatch the colors of the particles, a bonus mode will be triggered. White particles will begin to appear and these can destroy any particles they touch. White particles give bonus points when destroying other particles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/d3b0f8cc2d345cab95cccc904333ca9c.poster.avif?t=1777163183\" width=300 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/d3b0f8cc2d345cab95cccc904333ca9c.webm?t=1777163183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are six ranks: Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum, Master and Grandmaster. Try to make it Grandmaster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/4d1cbf719d6dcf4d25031690baf38667.avif?t=1777163183\" width=1489 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the FREE demo! The demo has a score limit of 220000 points.</p>",
